        "SupremeExpert2": {
          "DisplayName": "The Unwritten Tomorrow",
          "Tooltip": "Increase all damage by 15%. Press Final Rewind (default V; rebind in Controls) to return to your position about two seconds ago, with about 0.13 seconds of protection. Cooldown: 45 seconds.\nPosition only: no life, mana or cooldown restoration. Maximum distance: 62.5 tiles. Cannot cross solid blocks or active Supreme hazards.\nDuring Supreme encounters, both positions must be within 37.5 tiles of the arena center. Disabled during other bosses, opening trials, grappling or riding.\nMutually exclusive with earlier accessories of this divine line. Cooldowns persist through death and re-equipping."
        },
